close_reason: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/227 merged 2026-11-10T19:48:53Z; merge SHA 3a69b475fbf83af0ac859bdf0bfe7afd9032241c; PR head d71db1566c710df98c982d52ab48f28c0110ab0e. Delivered: Bounded lifecycle-compensation quarantine to exactly verified SDK versions with regression guards; unresolved upstream guarantees remain explicitly skipped. Green at that head: test (22), codeql, verified-auto-merge / dependabot-merge, verified-auto-merge / dependabot-merge, test (26), bun-release (22), bun-release (26), CodeQL, semgrep-cloud-platform/scan. Other check outcomes: audit-armed-requests: SKIPPED; audit-armed-requests: SKIPPED; CodeRabbit: SKIPPED; Sourcery review: SKIPPED (not counted as green)."
